{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After descending into a broken underworld, you are forced to learn new ways to traverse the harsh areas of hell. Rocket-jump using fireballs and master an ever growing moveset. Explore the non-linear corners of the underworld and find the Eye of Evil to free the damned from the heavens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the explosion force of fireballs to master rocket-jumping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock unique tools and abilities which help you reach new areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nonlinear, explore and collect items in whatever order you choose</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master movement</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the deep movement system</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many abilities interact with each other in interesting ways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the world the way you like using precise movement and some creativity</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter strange enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be observant, enemies do not always act as you expect</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3737610?t=1755256230","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737610/37c89e1c60c95a8351293cf69e26011bd41aa787/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755256230","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737610/32b88fdcaf4598613a12d9a9df4dc826666c93d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755256230","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737610/32b88fdcaf4598613a12d9a9df4dc826666c93d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755256230",